{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID110","SecondaryAttribute":"Careful: Attention Check\u00a0 In some versions of the study, we included a scenario that tests if you..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Careful: Attention Check&nbsp;<\/b><\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>\nIn some versions of the study, we included a scenario that tests if you are actually reading the scenarios or not. If your answers indicated that you did not properly read the scenario, <strong>the survey will stop and you will not be paid<\/strong>. If you continue, we assume that you are fine with this procedure. Otherwise, please stop now.&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Careful: Attention Check\u00a0 In some versions of the study, we included a scenario that tests if you...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Careful: Attention Check&nbsp;<\/b><\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>\nIn some versions of the study, we included a scenario that tests if you are actually reading the scenarios or not. If the answer indicated that you did not read the scenario, <strong>the survey will stop and you will not be paid<\/strong>. If you continue, we assume that you are fine with this procedure. Otherwise, please stop now.&nbsp;<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q110","QuestionID":"QID110"}},
