{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID102","SecondaryAttribute":"Consent Form\u00a0 We would like to invite you to take part in a research study.\u00a0Before you decide whe.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Consent Form&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">We would like to invite you to take part in a research study.&nbsp;Before you decide whether you would like to take part it is important that you understand why the research is being done and what it would involve.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center;\">Please take time to carefully read the following&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/cityunilondon.eu.qualtrics.com\/CP\/File.php?F=F_9HOF1jnzX1oMsEC\" target=\"_blank\">Participant information Sheet<\/a> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center;\">(click on link).&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Please then tick the boxes below to indicate that you have read and understood the information provided in the information sheet.<\/span><\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidthPixels":557,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Consent Form\u00a0 We would like to invite you to take part in a research study.\u00a0Before you decide whe...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">I confirm that I have read and understood the participant information Version 2.718, dated Aug 9th, 2024 for the above study. I have had the opportunity to consider the information and ask questions which have been answered satisfactorily.<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>I understand this will involve: Making decisions about whether or not to sacrifice the lives of a few people to save the lives of many people.<\/strong><\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">I understand that my participation is voluntary and that I am free to withdraw without giving a reason without being penalised or disadvantaged. <\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">I understand that my participation is voluntary and that I am free to withdraw without giving a reason without being penalised or disadvantaged.<\/span>"},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">I understand that anonymous data may be shared in data repositories.<\/span>"},"6":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">I agree to City recording and processing this information about me. I understand that this information will be used only for the purpose(s) explained in the participant information and my consent is conditional on City complying with its duties and obligations under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).<\/span>"},"8":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">I agree to take part in the above study.<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5,6,8],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":10,"NextAnswerId":2,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"}},"AnswerOrder":["1"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Consent Form&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">We would like to invite you to take part in a research study.&nbsp;Before you decide whether you would like to take part it is important that you understand why the research is being done and what it would involve.&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center;\">Please take time to carefully read the following <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/cityunilondon.eu.qualtrics.com\/CP\/File.php?F=F_bPCi9f3sr6MzOWV\" target=\"_blank\">Participant Information Sheet<\/a> <span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center;\">(click on link).&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Please then tick the boxes below to indicate that you have read and understood the information provided in the information sheet.<\/span><\/span><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q102","QuestionID":"QID102"}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID108","SecondaryAttribute":"Decision Making Task \u00a0 You will now read through 24 scenarios. At the end of each paragraph, an a..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Decision Making Task<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>You will now read through 24 scenarios. At the end of each paragraph, an action will be described. Your task is to indicate to what extent it is acceptable to perform the described action. At this point you must indicate on a 6-point scale whether the action is acceptable or not.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>\"1\" means that the action is <em>completely unacceptable<\/em> while \"6\" means that it is <em>completely acceptable<\/em>.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Decision Making Task \u00a0 You will now read through 24 scenarios. At the end of each paragraph, an a...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Decision Making Task<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>You will now read through 12 scenarios. At the end of each paragraph, an action will be described. Your task is to indicate to what extent it is acceptable to perform the described action. At this point you must indicate on a 6-point scale whether the action is acceptable or not.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>\"1\" means that the action is <em>completely unacceptable<\/em> while \"6\" means that it is <em>completely acceptable<\/em>.<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q108","QuestionID":"QID108"}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3640","SecondaryAttribute":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, some inhabitants are at ris...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Dietary supplements<\/b><br><br>\n\nDue to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, some inhabitants are at risk of thacium deficiency, and need water fortified with thacium to survive. After a Tsunami, these islands are cut off from the outside world. A lack of fortified water will kill people with thacium deficiency before any evacuation mission can be mounted.\n<br> <br>\nYou are the official in charge of disaster relief. If you decide to use a tanker plane to airlift drinking water fortified with thacium, this will save all of the 400 people with thacium deficiency.  However, it will also kill all of the 40 people with thacium intolerance who can survive without thacium, but who will suffer severe and excruciatingly painful muscle spasms for two days before finally dying.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.dietarySupplement.vivid.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.400.n_total.440.n_victims.40.ratio_saved_victims.10.text","QuestionID":"QID3640","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, some inhabitants are at ris...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3676","SecondaryAttribute":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, some inhabitants are at ris...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Dietary supplements<\/b><br><br>\n\nDue to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, some inhabitants are at risk of thacium deficiency, and need water fortified with thacium to survive. After a Tsunami, these islands are cut off from the outside world. A lack of fortified water will kill people with thacium deficiency before any evacuation mission can be mounted.\n<br> <br>\nYou are the official in charge of disaster relief. If you decide to use a tanker plane to airlift drinking water fortified with thacium, this will save all of the 80 people with thacium deficiency.  However, it will also kill all of the 20 people with thacium intolerance who can survive without thacium, but who will suffer severe and excruciatingly painful muscle spasms for two days before finally dying.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.dietarySupplement.vivid.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.80.n_total.250.n_victims.20.ratio_saved_victims.4.text","QuestionID":"QID3676","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, some inhabitants are at ris...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
