{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID5764","SecondaryAttribute":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, some inhabitants are at ris...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Dietary supplements<\/b><br><br>\n\nDue to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, some inhabitants are at risk of thacium deficiency, and need water fortified with thacium to survive. After a Tsunami, these islands are cut off from the outside world. A lack of fortified water will kill people with thacium deficiency before an evacuation mission can be mounted.\n<br> <br>\nIf the official in charge of disaster relief decides to use a tanker plane to airlift drinking water fortified with thacium, this will save all of the 200 people with thacium deficiency. However, it will also kill all of the 10 people with thacium intolerance who can survive without thacium, but who will die with similar symptoms to thacium deficiency.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.dietarySupplement.neutral.counterbalancing_group.2.n_saved.200.n_total.210.n_victims.10.ratio_saved_victims.20.text","QuestionID":"QID5764","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Dietary supplements Due to the parasites endemic on Minnegamau Isles, some inhabitants are at ris...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3637","SecondaryAttribute":"Flooding Valleys Valleys in the Whitgus mountains are protected from floods by dams which are how...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Flooding Valleys<\/b><br><br>\n\nValleys in the Whitgus mountains are protected from floods by dams which are however badly maintained. One day during the spring snow melt, the dam protecting Leefside Valley collapses. If nothing is done, Leefside Valley will be flooded, and all inhabitants will drown.\n<br> <br>\nThe operations engineer can open floodgates in another dam, which would trigger a massive mudslide engulfing Llyne Valley and kill all of the people there.\n<br> <br>\nYou are the operations engineer. If you decide to open the flood gates, you will save all of the 5,000 people in Leefside Valley, but will kill all of the 100 people in Llyne Valley who will be trapped in mud for hours before being painfully crushed and finally dying of asphyxiation.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.valleysFlooding.vivid.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.5000.n_total.5100.n_victims.100.ratio_saved_victims.50.text","QuestionID":"QID3637","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Flooding Valleys Valleys in the Whitgus mountains are protected from floods by dams which are how...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
