{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3769","SecondaryAttribute":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 1...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Human sacrifice<\/b><br><br>\n\nFor his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 10 people. These people will be thrown into a snake pit. If there are not enough volunteers, he will kill all of the 5,000 Whotnir by poisoning all their water wells with a fast-acting poison.\n<br> <br>\nThe governor of the Whotnir region has selected a group of sacrificees who are trying to flee and to hide in the capital, where they will survive if they make it. The governor of the Whotnir region has located this group and can detain them to have them sacrificed, which would save the remaining Whotnir.\n<br> <br>\nYou are this governor. If you decide to detain the escapees, you will save all of the remaining 5,000 Whotnir, but all of the 10 escapees will suffer severe pain from the snake venom before dying after being thrown into the snake pit.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.humanSacrifice.vivid.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.5000.n_total.4010.n_victims.10.ratio_saved_victims.500.text","QuestionID":"QID3769","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Human sacrifice For his imperial cult, the king of Chirfiqa asks the Whotnir tribe to sacrifice 1...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
