{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3610","SecondaryAttribute":"In Ankradem, there are some experimenters who would like to make sure that you are still reading...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In Ankradem, there are some experimenters who would like to make sure that you are still reading these scenarios. We are sure you do, but these pesky experimenters just have to insist. Please please select 2,000 divided by one thousand (that is, two) for both&nbsp;questions below to show that you have read this text.\nIf the mayor of Ankradem decides to kill 3,000 people, nobody will die because the city doesn't exist. If anyone were to die, the death would be really painful though.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"attChk.text","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In Ankradem, there are some experimenters who would like to make sure that you are still reading...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID3610"}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3643","SecondaryAttribute":"Limited health budget The government of Solandia faces a severe budget shortfall just when a majo...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Limited health budget<\/b><br><br>\n\nThe government of Solandia faces a severe budget shortfall just when a major outbreak of Zephyrion Disease occurs. Zephyrion Disease is a deadly, but relatively pain-free disease that kills infected people within one day.\n<br> <br>\nYou are the health minister of Solandia. If you use the budget allocated to pay for drugs for Astronexis Syndrome in order to buy drugs for Zephyrion Disease instead, you will save all of the 400,000 people infected by Zephyrion Disease. However, you will also kill all of the 200 Astronexis Syndrome patients, who will see their body paralyzed muscle by muscle before finally dying and suffer excruciating pain in the process.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.healthBudget.vivid.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.400000.n_total.12020.n_victims.200.ratio_saved_victims.2000.text","QuestionID":"QID3643","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Limited health budget The government of Solandia faces a severe budget shortfall just when a majo...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
