{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID5737","SecondaryAttribute":"Remote treatment The Cumberree Mountain range is a remote mountain range renowned for its beauty...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Remote treatment<\/b><br><br>\n\nThe Cumberree Mountain range is a remote mountain range renowned for its beauty and clean air. It is home to a hospital specialized for treating Pink Flu, a deadly disease requiring continuous medical care, but from which patients usually recover. The mountain range is also home to a village dedicated to holding arts festivals.\n<br> <br>\nThere is a Pink Flu outbreak in the village, and the attendees require immediate medical attention. However, the only medical personnel available are from the Pink Flu hospital, whose patients will all die if staff are withdrawn to attend to the attendees.\n<br> <br>\nIf the medical team of the Pink Flu hospital is moved to attend to the attendees, this will save all of the 300 attendees with Pink Flu, but will kill all of the 20 Pink Flu patients in the hospital.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.remoteTreatment.neutral.counterbalancing_group.2.n_saved.300.n_total.320.n_victims.20.ratio_saved_victims.15.text","QuestionID":"QID5737","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Remote treatment The Cumberree Mountain range is a remote mountain range renowned for its beauty...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID103","SecondaryAttribute":"Thank you for taking part in this study.\u00a0Our research team at City St George's, University of Lon..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\">Thank you for taking part in this study.&nbsp;Our research team at City St George's, University of London is interested in learning what people think about difficult situations and how to act in these situations. We would like to learn from your personal thoughts.<\/div>\n\n<p><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Thank you for taking part in this study.\u00a0Our research team at City St George's, University of Lon...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":11,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\">Thank you for taking part in this study.&nbsp;Our research team at City, University of London is interested in learning what people think about difficult situations and how to act in these situations. We would like to learn from your personal thoughts.<\/div>\n\n<p><o:p><\/o:p><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q103","QuestionID":"QID103"}},
{"SurveyID":"SV_5szpmzBE6gxqTwq","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3616","SecondaryAttribute":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Toxic factory<\/b><br><br>\n\nA fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills within seconds even in minimal doses. If released, everybody in the surrounding area will be killed, though the factory workers themselves will be fine due to their respiratory equipment.\n<br> <br>\nYou are the head of the firefighters. You can prevent the release of heptahopretyde by adding a chemical catalyst to the fire so the heptahopretyde splits up into harmless compounds. This will save all of the 80 people in the surrounding area. However, this will also increase the fire temperature, and all of the 20 workers in the factory will die a painful death, being burned and asphyxiated alive.<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.toxicFactory.vivid.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.80.n_total.250.n_victims.20.ratio_saved_victims.4.text","QuestionID":"QID3616","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","QuestionDescription":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[]}},
